{"id":"regio_n","lemma":"región","pos":"noun","rank":2631,"glosses":["region"],"ipa":"/reˈxjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"regiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-regi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esta región ha cambiado completamente.","en":"This region has completely changed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705630","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"changed"},{"g":"completely"}]},{"text":"Encontramos oro en esa región.","en":"We found gold in that region.","words":[{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"gold."},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"El río inundó toda la región.","en":"The river flooded the entire region.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687570","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"river"},{"g":"to flood, to inundate","l":"inundar"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Casi nunca llueve en esta región.","en":"It hardly ever rains in the area.","words":[{"g":"almost"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"to rain","l":"llover"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"La comida todavía es escasa en la región.","en":"Food is still scarce in the region.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"food"},{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"scarce","l":"escaso"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}